# Q37 What process does a Named KPI candidate sit on? (the measure part; q37b is the concepts part)
PREFIX kpi: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/>
PREFIX kind: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/measure-kind/>
PREFIX measure: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/measure/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
SELECT ?measure ?process WHERE {
  ?measure kpi:kpiCandidate true ; kpi:informsProcess ?process .
}
